# The lock screen's PAM service inside desk-nest, in place of the real
# desk-lock: pam_exec hands what was typed to the check, which accepts only
# the fixture word nest-unlock. A failed check is ignored and pam_deny
# answers instead, so the lock shows "wrong", as for a wrong password,
# rather than pam_exec's system error.
auth [success=done default=ignore] @pam_exec@ expose_authtok quiet quiet_log @check@
auth requisite @pam_deny@
